==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|explicāre}}, present active infinitive of {{m|la|explicō||unfold", "to explain}}.

===Verb===
{{en-verb|explicat}}

# {{lb|en|transitive}} To [[explain]] [[meticulous|meticulously]] or in great [[detail]]; to [[elucidate]]; to [[analyze]].
#: ''My homework is to '''explicate''' a poem.''

